<title>DENMARK: Danish Great Belt adds 500 mln DKK to 4 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Great Belt adds 500 mln DKK to 4 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish bridge-building consortium Great Belt A/S said on Friday that interest in its 1.2 billion crown four percent bond announced on Tuesday had been so great that it was increasing the offer by 500 million crowns to 1.7 billion.</p>
<p>A statement by lead manager Unibank said that other aspects of the offer were unchanged.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
